WEBVTT

00:16:00.302 --> 00:16:01.457
No.

00:16:01.481 --> 00:16:03.436
The question is, "Is that an illusion?"

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.867
And I'll leave you with that.

00:16:04.891 --> 00:16:06.096
So, thank you very much.

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.285
(Laughter)

00:16:07.309 --> 00:16:10.000
(Applause)